{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042920/extras/4e7eeef8cf6157b450a1559ca4ae1f50.avif?t=1758926755\" width=1500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201c<strong>Izakaya Izakoza</strong>\u201d is a deckbuilding roguelike that combines card battles with grid-based strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully animated, lively characters jump through the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponents this time are none other than the guests who visit the izakaya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share heartfelt conversations, serve nostalgic dishes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, settle things through heated brawls, end up as friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each relationship with a guest unfolds into unique stories and special rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day that begins with conversation, flows through food, and ends with a climactic fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>\u201cIzakaya Izakoza\u201d</strong> where all of these coexist at a single table!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042920?t=1758926755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4042920?t=1758926755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042920/fa3fddc4d84e0d6f5a870e4ec2107b1bc102267d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758926755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042920/fa3fddc4d84e0d6f5a870e4ec2107b1bc102267d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758926755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c